  "notes": "{打開|だかい} refers to breaking through a difficult situation or deadlock.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {局面|きょくめん}を{打開|だかい}する (break through an impasse)\n- {現状|げんじょう}{打開|だかい} (breaking through the status quo)\n- {打開|だかい}{策|さく} (breakthrough strategy)\n- {打開|だかい}の{糸口|いとぐち} (clue to a breakthrough)\n\nRELATED TERM: {突破|とっぱ} is similar but emphasizes forcefully breaking through, while {打開|だかい} emphasizes resolving a difficult situation.",
